  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ki can be more powerful when you expend your ki focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you expend your ki focus, if you deal damage, you increase the size of the die type rolled by one step. For example, if you have this feat and use Tiger Fist Chakra, when you expend your ki focus in an attack, you roll 1d10 instead of 1d8 for the damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc111\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
